# Build context is container/. Keep only what the Dockerfile COPYs; everything
# else (the staged fly.toml.deploy, stray files) just slows the upload.
fly.toml
fly.toml.deploy
package.json
*.md
# ...except the docs the Dockerfile COPYs into the image (the box agents' standing
# orders + the governance the charter points them at). Without these un-ignores, the
# *.md rule above strips them from the build context and the COPY fails ("not found").
!team-charter.md
!CODEX-ENGINEERING-CHARTER.md
!OPERATOR-CARDINAL-RULES.md
!TEAM-PROCESS.md
!RULE-CONSTITUTION.md
!TRANSCENDENCE.md
!OPERATING-PRINCIPLES.md
